name: A separately approved context candidate retains baseline accounting and compares real run receipts
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NO_COLOR NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_experiment.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: use sast
submit: options sast:scan
submit: set taskMode manual
submit: set tasks agentic
paste-file: @ART/open-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | candidate-draft
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 25 Observed: 1 provider requests | selected-baseline
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_experiment.py @TMP_TARGET @ART hide-accounting
keys: Down Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Baseline allowance could not be read | baseline-allowance-failed
expect: Accounting unavailable · work blocked
ask: Does the failed allowance read keep the baseline and draft, block preparation and disclose a read-only retry without another request or a fresh spending account?
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_experiment.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restore-accounting
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 Calls: 3 committed / 8 total | baseline-allowance-recovered
expect: Baseline allowance read.
keys: Up Down
require-live-snap: 25 Only context may differ | explicit-context-comparison
ask: Does enabling comparison name an explicit historical baseline, retain its investigation and spending, and require a separately approved candidate with only context changed?
keys: Up Up Up Up Up Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CHOOSE STUDY CONTEXT | candidate-context-choice
keys: Up Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Labeled diagram Beta | exact-beta
keys: a
require-live-snap: 20 Context selected for this study | chosen-context
keys: L
require-live-snap: 30 Draft ready | frozen-candidate
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_experiment.py @TMP_TARGET @ART draft
keys: Down Down Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 20 Baseline conditions authenticated | reviewed-context-conditions
resize: 160x48
live-snap: conditions-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: conditions-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: conditions-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: conditions-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: conditions-40x12
keys: NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage
live-snap: conditions-small-last
ask: Can the operator read every comparison condition and cost limitation at all six sizes, with paging/back controls and no source, model or scope expansion hidden in a context experiment?
resize: 120x36
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW PLAN & ALLOWANCE | candidate-approval
keys: End
require-live-snap: 15 y approve | approval-last
expect: revision 1 → 2
expect: Total provider calls: 8
expect: 3 fixed jobs
ask: Does approval preserve the baseline's three committed requests within eight total and two protected review calls, approving only three candidate jobs with no automatic start or budget increase?
keys: y
require-live-snap: 25 Approval saved | approved-candidate
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 Plan approved | candidate-jobs
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 dispatcher pid | candidate-launched
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_experiment.py @TMP_TARGET @ART finished
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 3 job(s) · 3 completed | candidate-completed
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 APPROVED STUDY | recovered-plan
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 COMPARE CONTEXT EXPERIMENT | candidate-pass-choices
expect: Pass 1 · completed
expect: Pass 3 · completed
ask: Are the three actual candidate passes selectable for comparison without rerunning the baseline, spending again or changing decisions?
resize: 40x12
keys: Down Down
live-snap: pass-choice-40x12
expect: Pass 3 · completed
resize: 120x36
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 RUN DIFF | context-run-comparison
keys: Tab
live-snap: compared-context-sources
ask: Does run comparison disclose exact differing contexts and source identity while preserving raw observations and refusing to infer a fix from a nondeterministic miss?
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 COMPARE CONTEXT EXPERIMENT | comparison-origin-restored
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME NO_COLOR=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/resume-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 3 job(s) · 3 completed | recovered-campaign
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 APPROVED STUDY | recovered-experiment
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 COMPARE CONTEXT EXPERIMENT | recovered-pass-choices
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_experiment.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: After a real no-color restart, do baseline binding, exact candidate context, three completed passes and six committed intercepted requests recover without another request or a changed active context?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
